PN,14215
SC,0015
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 142 Tue 17 NovC16:41/43
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}        G15/15
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCStormont backs call for BBC       
OL,4,CNorthern Ireland to explain cuts       
OL,6,FBBC Northern Ireland must save #4.1m by
OL,7,Fthe end of 2027/28, as part of the     
OL,8,FBBC's #500m savings target.            
OL,10,FBroadcasting is a reserved matter, so  
OL,11,Fthe motion is not binding. But it puts 
OL,12,Fthe Assembly on record ahead of the BBC
OL,13,Fcharter review next year.              
OL,23,EPub: 16-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
